      "content": "i know they'll say they support me but i can just see it in their eyes. the pity. the way they look at me like i'm some kind of cautionary tale. i’ve spent my whole life building this reputation, and now i'm just watching it all rot. instead of a slow, humiliating crawl to the bottom where i'm just some broken guy begging for scraps, i just feel like i'm plummeting. it feels like the descent is inevitable and there's no way to stop the shame from becoming my whole identity.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
